---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="SortApp + CheckinApp — Kennedy Ekanem"
  description="A modular guest operations and event check-in system."
>
  <article class="project-page">
    <a class="back-link" href="/#work">← Back to work</a>

    <header class="project-header">
      <p class="project-meta">Product engineering · Event operations</p>
      <h1>SortApp + CheckinApp</h1>
      <p class="project-intro">
        A modular guest operations system built to make high-profile event access
        simple, personal, and fast.
      </p>
    </header>

    <figure class="project-image">
      <img src="/images/sortapp.png" alt="SortApp guest management dashboard" />
      <figcaption>SortApp’s guest management dashboard.</figcaption>
    </figure>

    <section class="project-copy">
      <h2>Overview</h2>
      <p>
        Event teams often manage guest information across spreadsheets, email tools,
        and manual check-in lists. SortApp brings those steps into one focused workflow.
      </p>
      <p>
        The application imports guest data from CSV files, creates personalized access
        cards with unique QR codes, and sends them by email through @UsePlunk.
      </p>

      <h2>At the event</h2>
      <p>
        CheckinApp gives the team a quick way to search for guests and validate their
        access on arrival. This reduces manual coordination and keeps the entrance moving.
      </p>

      <dl class="details">
        <div><dt>Role</dt><dd>Product engineer</dd></div>
        <div><dt>Built for</dt><dd>Event and guest operations</dd></div>
        <div><dt>Core flow</dt><dd>Import → personalize → send → verify</dd></div>
        <div><dt>Integration</dt><dd>UsePlunk email delivery</dd></div>
      </dl>
    </section>

    <nav class="project-nav" aria-label="Project navigation">
      <a href="/#work">All projects</a>
      <a href="/projects/landest">Next project →</a>
    </nav>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .project-page{width:min(100% - 40px,680px);margin:0 auto;padding:64px 0 100px}.project-header{margin-top:72px;padding-bottom:28px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}.project-meta{margin:0 0 4px;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}.project-header h1{margin:0;font:clamp(34px,5vw,46px)/1.15 var(--serif);letter-spacing:-.035em}.project-intro{max-width:620px;margin:24px 0 0;color:var(--muted);font-size:17px;line-height:1.7}.project-image{margin:38px 0 0}.project-image img{width:100%;padding:28px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px;background:var(--soft)}.project-image figcaption{margin-top:9px;color:var(--muted);font-size:11px}.project-copy{margin-top:58px;font-size:17px;line-height:1.8}.project-copy h2{margin:48px 0 10px;font:26px/1.3 var(--serif);letter-spacing:-.02em}.project-copy h2:first-child{margin-top:0}.project-copy p{margin:0 0 20px;color:var(--muted)}.details{margin:50px 0 0;border-top:1px solid var(--line)}.details div{display:grid;grid-template-columns:130px 1fr;gap:20px;padding:13px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}.details dt{color:var(--muted);font:10px Mono;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.1em}.details dd{margin:0;font-size:13px}.project-nav{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;margin-top:68px;padding-top:20px;border-top:1px solid var(--line);font-size:13px}.project-nav a:hover{text-decoration:underline}
  @media(max-width:600px){.project-page{padding-top:38px}.project-header{margin-top:48px}.project-header h1{font-size:32px}.project-intro{font-size:15px}.project-image img{padding:12px}.project-copy{margin-top:44px;font-size:16px}.details div{grid-template-columns:100px 1fr}}
</style>
<style>
  figure.project-image{width:100%!important;max-width:100%;margin:38px 0 0!important;padding:24px;transform:none!important;aspect-ratio:auto;overflow:visible;background:var(--soft);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px}
  figure.project-image img{width:100%;height:auto!important;padding:0;border:0;border-radius:4px;object-fit:contain!important;background:transparent}
  figure.project-image figcaption{margin:12px 0 -12px}
  @media(max-width:600px){figure.project-image{padding:12px}figure.project-image figcaption{margin-bottom:-4px}}
</style>
